---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BriefingForm from '../../components/BriefingForm.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Southern Europe Capital Strategy 2026 | Costa Ledger" 
  minimalHeader={true} 
  headerLabel="PRIVATE SUBSCRIBER PORTAL" 
  isAdvertorial={true}
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-14">
    
    <!-- ARTICLE HEADER -->
    <header class="mb-8 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-8 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-[#C5A059] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[10px] uppercase block mb-3">
        SPECIAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT
      </span>
      
      <!-- TITLE -->
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#121212] leading-tight mb-4">
        The Capital Shift: How High-Net-Worth Investors Are Navigating Europe's New Fiscal Rules
      </h1>

      <!-- LEDE (SUBTITLE / INTRO) -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#666666] font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
        A quiet overhaul of cross-border tax incentives and residency pathways is prompting institutional investors and private capitals to restructure assets across Spain, Portugal, and Italy.
      </p>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-[#666666] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">
        <span>Costa Ledger Intelligence Unit</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Read Time: 4 Mins</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
        alt="Southern Europe Investment Asset" 
        class="w-full h-[280px] sm:h-[400px] object-cover border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm"
      />
      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#666666] mt-2 block text-right italic font-serif">
        Market positioning across key Mediterranean corridors, Q3 2026.
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTENT (NARRATIVE) -->
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-3xl mx-auto font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#2A2E33] space-y-6">
      <p class="first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:font-bold first-letter:text-[#121212] first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-3 first-letter:mt-1">
        As Southern European economies realign their foreign investment incentives, high-net-worth individuals are moving quickly to adapt to shifting legislative frameworks.
      </p>

      <p>
        The window for legacy residency pathways and simplified tax regimes is closing. What remains requires a far more strategic approach to asset allocation, legal structuring, and lifestyle migration.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-sans font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl uppercase tracking-wider mt-8 mb-2 text-[#121212]">
        Key Strategic Takeaways
      </h2>

      <p>
        In our latest private research, we analyze the exact regulatory shifts taking place in Q3 2026 and outline actionable strategies for wealth preservation and cross-border mobility.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- LEAD CAPTURE FORM / FINAL CTA -->
    <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <BriefingForm 
        source="advertorial_capital_shift" 
        title="ACCESS THE COMPLETE BRIEFING"
        subtitle="Direct delivery to your inbox. High signal market intelligence."
        buttonText="SUBSCRIBE & ACCESS REPORT"
        showCheckboxes={false}
      />
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>